/*
 * Implements validation and construction of literal values.
 *
 * This module dispatches literal expressions to the appropriate specialized
 * validator (int, float, char, string, array, tuple, map, etc.) and provides
 * direct validation routines for primitive literals such as:
 * 
 *   - bool
 *   - null
 *   - none
 *   - unit
 *   - dollar expressions ($)
 *
 * The validator ensures that each literal is converted into the correct
 * semantic Value node and enforces contextual rules (e.g., $ outside a slice
 * context).
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::literal::root
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/literal/root.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-26
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
